! S01 installation and version: the solver answers and reports its revision (no model, no solve)
/TITLE,VKM ladder S01 - installation and version
*GET,VKM_REV,ACTIVE,0,REV
*GET,VKM_NPROC,ACTIVE,0,NPROC
*CFOPEN,vkm_results,txt
*VWRITE,VKM_REV
('rev = ',E24.16)
*VWRITE,VKM_NPROC
('nproc = ',E24.16)
*CFCLOSE
FINISH
